ock new paths to The Core, chat with the locals, listen to tunes, and drink boosting (and delicious) libations. Then, jump back into the Station and try to get out -- again. </p>", "short_description": "ENDLESS Dungeon™ is a Rogue-lite Tactical Action game, set in the award-winning ENDLESS Universe™. Recruit a team of shipwrecked heroes, plunge into a long-abandoned space station, and protect your crystal against never-ending waves of monsters… or die trying, get reloaded, and try again.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean, Polish, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1485590/d3bbc0007c1db60359f7bdd89cce5380961e8f3b/header.jpg?t=1787684132", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1485590/0ee6afe98adc2c09c433e645a8961f2542daaf88/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787684132", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1485590/0ee6afe98adc2c09c433e645a8961f2542daaf88/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787684132", "website": "https://endlessdungeon.game", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 64-Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Desktop's Intel Core i5 4th generation / AMD FX-8370 or any Desktop's AMD Ryzen<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 760 / AMD R9 280<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 11 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 720p, Medium quality, 30fps</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS